    1 PRGSTART
    3 SECTION VARS,//ONE NAME DECLARED TWICE, AND ONE TOO LONG//
    4   DEC TOTAL INIT 0
    5   DEC TOTAL INIT 1
    6   DEC OVERLONG INIT 0
    7   DEC AB INIT 0
    8 ENDSECT VARS
   10 SECTION MAIN,//A BRANCH AND A VALUE THAT NAME NOTHING//
   12   [BEGIN] SET TOTAL = MISSNG+OVERLONG+AB
   13   GO TO NOWHER
   14   GO TO NOWHER
   16 ENDSECT MAIN
   18 PRGEND
